### ========== MESSAGING WEBHOOKS ==========

### Verify Meta Webhook (Facebook/WhatsApp/Instagram)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/messaging/webhook/verify?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.challenge=test_challenge_123&hub.verify_token=test-verify-token

### WhatsApp Message Webhook
POST http://localhost:4000/api/messaging/webhook/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
x-hub-signature-256: sha256=SIGNATURE_PLACEHOLDER

{
  "object": "whatsapp_business_account",
  "entry": [
    {
      "id": "WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID",
      "changes": [
        {
          "value": {
            "messaging_product": "whatsapp",
            "metadata": {
              "display_phone_number": "15551234567",
              "phone_number_id": "1234567890"
            },
            "contacts": [
              {
                "profile": {
                  "name": "John Doe"
                },
                "wa_id": "15559876543"
              }
            ],
            "messages": [
              {
                "from": "15559876543",
                "id": "wamid.ABC123",
                "timestamp": "1706745600",
                "type": "text",
                "text": {
                  "body": "I want to book a room"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "field": "messages"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Instagram Message Webhook
POST http://localhost:4000/api/messaging/webhook/instagram
Content-Type: application/json
x-hub-signature-256: sha256=SIGNATURE_PLACEHOLDER

{
  "object": "instagram",
  "entry": [
    {
      "id": "INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_ID",
      "time": 1706745600,
      "messaging": [
        {
          "sender": {
            "id": "1234567890"
          },
