### ========== TESTING WORKER FLOW ==========
### NOTE: Workers process jobs asynchronously via BullMQ/Redis
### 1. Send webhook (above) → Message saved + AI job enqueued
### 2. AI worker processes message → Generates response
### 3. Check logs: docker logs -f backend_api (or console if running locally)
### 4. Query database to see bot messages

